*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
server/prisma/*.db

# Agent / one-off workspaces (not product source)
skill-fallback/
/UI-REDESIGN-PROGRESS.md

# Coverage
coverage/

# Prisma client generated to a custom path (local worktree only; never commit)
server/.generated-prisma-client/
.generated-prisma-client/

# Generated mail HTML previews (local only)
outputs/mail-previews/

# D-02 denomination backtest operational outputs (never commit real extracts)
artifacts/value-policy-d02-backtest/

# Python helper bytecode (F0 dbguard harness)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Design-system generation output (local-only; never commit)
# All of generated/ stays out of version control, including the v3 design-review draft.
design-system/monexus/generated/

# AstrBot 签到插件（独立分发件，不属于 MoNexus 代码库）
# 通过 zip 单独交付，版本节奏与后端解耦，避免插件代码混进主仓库的 PR。
docs/integrations/
